rance of a mysterious Mist, the island has recently fallen into chaos, and Ardeshir must wield his flaming sword and use powerful abilities to confront its mysteries and free Nahran.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• \nRepel a dynamically generated Mist that reacts to the flames of your sword.\n\n• \nCarry your flames across Nahran: your blade can also ignite the environment, activate mechanisms, and even destroy creatures born from the Mist.\n\n• \nDefeat enemies and explore the environment to collect ash, which can be offered to Phoenix statues. You'll gain new skills and bonuses vital for your survival.\n\n• \nExplore a compact island offering a streamlined experience centered around a singular concept. (game length: around 3 hours)","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/d6906a04c502c2507ad67e2fb34ad901ab02a8f5/header.jpg?t=1782833654"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/b3a7303807116f47e723267e3fd4b8fa7e00a5b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782833654"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/ss_4be92d4f0e59cea300712c6a96987786ddbdecc0.600x338.jpg?t=1782833654","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/ss_4be92d4f0e59cea300712c6a96987786ddbdecc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782833654"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/ss_112777c69333747a899b9c8c07a2bd9d44a21537.600x338.jpg?t=1782833654","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/ss_112777c69333747a899b9c8c07a2bd9d44a21537.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782833654"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634080/ss_01